{"asset_key":"mn2/quest_story_10283300","episode":"mn2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10283300","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1028330001:1":{"text":"에취! 뭐야 이 냄새... 너무 지독하잖아!","source_cn":"阿——嚏！什么味道……太刺鼻了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x606B14483ABB989B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1028330002:1":{"text":"으음... 다들 왜 그런 눈으로 날 보는 거예요?","source_cn":"呃……你们怎么这么看着我？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26ACDEB04ADC02E9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1028330003:1":{"text":"갈리! 다행이야! 드디어 눈을 떴구나!","source_cn":"伽利！太好了！你终于醒了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB2A9CF605916A91C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1028330004:1":{"text":"나... 아까 묘약을 먹지 않았어? 왜... 머리가 좀 어지럽지? 한참 자는데 누가 갑자기 깨운 것 마냥...","source_cn":"我……刚才不是喝了灵药吗？怎么……有点头晕，像是睡到半...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0E42856B35D68B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1028330004":{"text":"나... 아까 묘약을 먹지 않았어? 왜... 머리가 좀 어지럽지? 한참 자는데 누가 갑자기 깨운 것 마냥...","source_cn":"我……刚才不是喝了灵药吗？怎么……有点头晕，像是睡到半夜被突然叫醒一样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC0E42856B35D68B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1028330005:1":{"text":"제가 먹은 건 영원한 젊음을 유지하는 묘약이었잖아요? 어떻게 된 거예요?","source_cn":"但我喝的不是永葆青春的灵药吗？到底是怎么回事？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC99BBD4F636AEA01","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1028330006:0":{"text":"뭐라고 설명해야 하지...","source_cn":"该怎么说呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC958EB64D5A9CF03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1028330006":{"text":"뭐라고 설명해야 하지...","source_cn":"该怎么说呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC958EB64D5A9CF03","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1028330009:1":{"text":"그러니까... 깊은 잠에 빠지는 게 “영원한 젊음”을 유지하는 거라고요?","source_cn":"什么？你是说，它用沉睡不醒的方式来让人“永葆青春”？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C217BD86F45F68E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1028330010:1":{"text":"하, 젊음!\n열정도, 꿈도 없이 그냥 잠에 빠져 누워있는 게 어떻게 “젊음”이죠?","source_cn":"哈，青春！\\n——没有激情、没有追求，一动不动睡在那里...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCCC87C031B5AB8F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1028330011:1":{"text":"무기력한 영원을 얻을 바에는 고고학에 제 모든 열정을 쏟아붓겠어요. 유한한 생명 속에서 진리라는 영원을 찾을 거예요!","source_cn":"比起沉睡的永恒，我宁愿为考古事业付出全部的激情——在有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5FF84990A6A0A0B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1028330012:1":{"text":"이게 진정한 “영원한 젊음”이죠! 적어도 학자에게는요...","source_cn":"这才是真正的永葆青春！至少，对学者来说是这样的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF9F608786381F884","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1028330013:1":{"text":"갈리, 널 위해 박수까지 쳐주고 싶을 정도 좋은 말이었어! 가끔 의견이 갈리기도 하지만, 이번만큼은 나도 같은 생각이야.","source_cn":"说得好！伽利，我都忍不住想给你鼓掌了。咱们时常有分歧，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20FBF7F4FC2F5A6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1028330014:1":{"text":"하지만 이렇게 되면, “고대 문명의 중대한 발견”이 하나 줄어드는데, 괜찮겠어?","source_cn":"不过这下，你就会少一个“上古文明的重大发现”了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x181BF4CD7930DCBD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1028330015:1":{"text":"고고학에 대한 열정과 꿈만 있다면, 분명 다음 “중대한 발견”을 찾을 수 있을 거야!","source_cn":"只要有对考古事业的激情和追求，我们一定会有下一个“重大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F228EA5899D5CED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1028330015":{"text":"고고학에 대한 열정과 꿈만 있다면, 분명 다음 “중대한 발견”을 찾을 수 있을 거야!","source_cn":"只要有对考古事业的激情和追求，我们一定会有下一个“重大发现”的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F228EA5899D5CED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1028330016:1":{"text":"물론이죠. 우린 앞으로도 영원히 지식을 탐구해 나갈 거예요!","source_cn":"当然，我们永远不会停下探求知识的步伐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x53CD0DE00CD83812","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1028330017:1":{"text":"다음에 만날 땐 학계에 이름을 남길만한 위대한 성과를 발견했을 거예요!","source_cn":"也许下次见面时，我们就会有能被学界铭记的重大成果了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3B444DE5C826FB3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1028330018:1":{"text":"여러분, 다음에 또 봐요! 여러모로 도와주셔서 정말 감사했어요!","source_cn":"再会啦，各位，谢谢你们的帮助！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9AD1579BDD5CA68C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:17:0:1":{"text":"다시 떠날 거야?","source_cn":"你们又要走了？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x69FBDA90D4B55955","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"다시 떠날 거야?","female":"다시 떠날 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"61766","variant_female_record_index":"61767","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_